THIẾU:
1. PaymentOrder (id, amount, status, paymentLinkId, planId) -> User
2. StoreContact (address, phone, email) -> embedded in Store
3. PasswordResetToken (id, token, expiryDate) -> User
4. PaymentSummary (type, totalAmount, transactionCount, percentage) -> embedded in ShiftReport

CẦN CẬP NHẬT FIELDS:
- Branch: thêm city, state, createdAt, updatedAt
- Product: thêm createdAt, updatedAt
- ShiftReport: thêm paymentSummaries, topSellingProducts, recentOrders relationships
- Refund: thêm cashier, branch FK
- Subscription: thêm paymentStatus, createdAt, updatedAt
- SubscriptionPlan: thêm enableAdvancedReports, enableInventory, enableIntegrations, enableEcommerce, enableInvoiceBranding, prioritySupport, enableMultiLocation
- Payment: thêm providerPaymentId, transactionId, method, failureReason, refundId, createdAt, updatedAt

THIẾU ENUMS:
- BillingCycle (MONTHLY, YEARLY)
- PaymentGateway (RAZORPAY, STRIPE)
- PaymentStatus (PENDING, COMPLETED, FAILED)
- PaymentOrderStatus (PENDING, SUCCESS, FAILED)
